    "decisions.cmp_clk_north_drop.verify: CLK-to-output mirror difference is 37.2 aF in total (2.1 aF core, 24.4 aF inside the SAR macro from its frozen pin order, about 10.5 aF from the routes) against the 7.4 aF v8 core level; CLK-to-input difference 5.3 aF from the declared unmirrored TOPP crossing. The comparator TT decision screen with the extracted environment is still to run.",
